flowchart LR
  subgraph CLIENT
    B[Browser / Next.js Client]
  end

  B -->|HTTP(S)| CDN[CDN (Cloudflare / CloudFront)]
  CDN -->|Cache static files & blobs| ObjectStore[R2 / S3]
  CDN -->|Edge SSR & API cache| NextEdge[Next.js Edge / Static]

  NextEdge -->|API / SSR requests| APIGW[API Gateway / Load Balancer]
  APIGW --> Backend[Backend API (Express / Fastify)]

  subgraph BACKEND_LAYER
    Backend --> Redis[Redis (primary cache) - GET/SET/EX|LRU]
    Backend --> InProc[In-process LRU cache (per instance) - short TTL]
    Backend --> DB[(Postgres via Prisma)]
    Backend --> R2[R2 / Object Storage (blobs, exports, segments)]
    Backend --> Workers[Workers / Queues (transcode, asr, export)]
    Backend --> WS[Studio WebSocket]
  end

  Workers --> Redis
  Workers --> R2
  Workers --> DB

  Redis -. PubSub .-> Workers
  Redis -. PubSub .-> Backend
  Redis -. Invalidate .-> CDN

  CDN -->|Logs & metrics| Observability
  Backend -->|metrics| Observability
  Workers -->|metrics| Observability

  subgraph Observability
    Observability[Prometheus / Grafana / Logging]
  end

  style CDN fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style Redis fill:#ffdead,stroke:#333
  style R2 fill:#d0f0c0,stroke:#333
  style DB fill:#f0d0d0,stroke:#333
  style Workers fill:#e6f0ff,stroke:#333
  style InProc fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#333
  style NextEdge fill:#efeaff,stroke:#333
  style Backend fill:#f7f7f7,stroke:#333